        "created_at": "2019-03-23T16:01:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm still working on getting better at this myself, but something I've found in the last couple of days is it's: sometimes important to flee to the other battle zone unless that hero can do massive damage to OblivAeon. However, nothing is really going to protect against double Temporal Fractures... that's just cruel!</p>",
